{"q":"67","t":"Add Binary","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Given two binary strings <code>a</code> and <code>b</code>, return <em>their sum as a binary string</em>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> a = \"11\", b = \"1\"\n<strong>Output:</strong> \"100\"\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> a = \"1010\", b = \"1011\"\n<strong>Output:</strong> \"10101\"\n</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= a.length, b.length &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>a</code> and <code>b</code> consist&nbsp;only of <code>&#39;0&#39;</code> or <code>&#39;1&#39;</code> characters.</li>\n\t<li>Each string does not contain leading zeros except for the zero itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"addBinary\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"a\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"b\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"string\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Bit Manipulation","slug":"bit-manipulation"},{"name":"Simulation","slug":"simulation"}],"s":[{"t":"Add Two Numbers","s":"add-two-numbers","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Multiply Strings","s":"multiply-strings","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Plus One","s":"plus-one","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Add to Array-Form of Integer","s":"add-to-array-form-of-integer","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["tcs","tcs"],["Visa","visa"],["Deloitte","deloitte"],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs"]],"cs":{"a":[["Amazon","amazon",8],["Google","google",6],["Meta","facebook",2],["Microsoft","microsoft",2]],"b":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2]],"m":[["tcs","tcs",6],["Deloitte","deloitte",3],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs",3],["Visa","visa",3],["IBM","ibm",2],["Infosys","infosys",2],["Wipro","wipro",2],["Yandex","yandex",2],["Snap","snapchat",2]]}}